        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_156ac1c7e7404a54b38de474046c0519",
      "statement": "The rates-regime note supplies a working regime assumption and recommends review, but does not itself set global multi-asset bands; the committee plans a 2026 annual review and has not yet changed the strategic weights for that note.",
