    {
      "id": "claim_f0191ba949e94be4a4adddb85ce7b9af",
      "statement": "Private-markets exposure is managed through commitment pacing: denominator-effect drift above target is neither a breach nor traded, whereas drift caused by over-commitment is a pacing failure escalated under D.4.",
