    {
      "id": "claim_a373c6b6a0404efc8d5b00729a5f142c",
      "statement": "For this allocation guidance, unfunded private-markets commitments are subject to a binding liquidity limit based on the private-markets research framework: they may not exceed two years of liquid portfolio spending.",
