      "statement": "If a research note underlying a band is superseded or withdrawn, the guidance suspends that band and returns to the prior committee-adopted level pending review; managers must escalate rather than re-derive the weight or adopt a replacement note, and the guide is reviewed annually and on cited-note reissue or withdrawal.",
